                    <script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https:\/\/schema.org","@type":"Recipe","name":"Cuketov\u00e9 rolky pln\u011bn\u00e9 tvar\u016f\u017ekovou p\u011bnou \u2013 jednoduch\u00e1 jednohubka s tradi\u010dn\u00edm \u010desk\u00fdm s\u00fdrem","description":"Cuketa, tvar\u016f\u017eky a parmsk\u00e1 \u0161unka. T\u0159i suroviny, kter\u00e9 na prvn\u00ed pohled mo\u017en\u00e1 nezn\u00ed jako klasick\u00e1 kombinace, ale v\u00fdsledek v\u00e1s p\u0159esv\u011bd\u010d\u00ed. Jemn\u011b ope\u010den\u00e9 pl\u00e1tky cukety, k tomu kr\u00e9mov\u00e1 p\u011bna z tvar\u016f\u017ek\u016f a pl\u00e1tek vo\u0148av\u00e9 parmsk\u00e9 \u0161unky v elegantn\u00ed rolce funguj\u00ed jako studen\u00fd p\u0159edkrm i chu\u0165ovka na rodinnou oslavu. Nen\u00e1ro\u010dn\u00e1 p\u0159\u00edprava, v\u00fdrazn\u00e1 chu\u0165 a efektn\u00ed vzhled. Takov\u00e1 dobrota zmiz\u00ed z tal\u00ed\u0159e d\u0159\u00edv, ne\u017e se oto\u010d\u00edte.","url":"https:\/\/fresh.iprima.cz\/cuketove-rolky-plnene-tvaruzkovou-penou-jednoducha-jednohubka-s-tradicnim-ceskym-syrem-519101","datePublished":"2026-08-12T11:10:39+02:00","mainEntityOfPage":"https:\/\/fresh.iprima.cz\/cuketove-rolky-plnene-tvaruzkovou-penou-jednoducha-jednohubka-s-tradicnim-ceskym-syrem-519101","dateModified":"2026-08-12T11:10:39+02:00","publisher":{"@context":"https:\/\/schema.org","@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","name":"FTV Prima","url":"https:\/\/fresh.iprima.cz","email":"online@iprima.cz","logo":{"@context":"https:\/\/schema.org","@type":"ImageObject","url":"\/images\/logo-bg.jpg","width":800,"height":424,"caption":"Prima Fresh","creditText":"FTV Prima","copyrightNotice":"FTV Prima","creator":{"@context":"https:\/\/schema.org","@type":"Organization","name":"FTV Prima"},"license":"https:\/\/www.iprima.cz\/vseobecne-podminky","acquireLicensePage":"https:\/\/www.iprima.cz\/vseobecne-podminky"},"sameAs":["https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/PrimaFresh.cz","https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/primafresh\/"],"alternateName":["Prima Fresh","Fresh Prima","Fresh"]},"copyrightYear":"2026","author":{"@context":"https:\/\/schema.org","@type":"Person","name":"redakce Prima FRESH","description":null,"url":""},"image":{"@context":"https:\/\/schema.org","@type":"ImageObject","url":"https:\/\/cdn.administrace.tv\/2026\/08\/12\/small_169\/eda62412240f6c85b53f4b85a714fa58.jpg","width":800,"height":450,"caption":"Cuketov\u00e9 rolky pln\u011bn\u00e9 tvar\u016f\u017ekovou p\u011bnou \u2013 jednoduch\u00e1 jednohubka s tradi\u010dn\u00edm \u010desk\u00fdm s\u00fdrem","creditText":"Olomouck\u00e9 tvar\u016f\u017eky","copyrightNotice":"Olomouck\u00e9 tvar\u016f\u017eky","creator":{"@context":"https:\/\/schema.org","@type":"Organization","name":"Olomouck\u00e9 tvar\u016f\u017eky"},"license":"https:\/\/www.iprima.cz\/vseobecne-podminky","acquireLicensePage":"https:\/\/www.iprima.cz\/vseobecne-podminky"},"recipeIngredient":["50 g olomouck\u00e9 tvar\u016f\u017eky","200 g smetana ke \u0161leh\u00e1n\u00ed","2 ks cuketa","50 g parmsk\u00e1 \u0161unka"," olej"],"keywords":["olomouck\u00e9 tvar\u016f\u017eky","smetana ke \u0161leh\u00e1n\u00ed","cuketa","parmsk\u00e1 \u0161unka","olej"],"totalTime":"PT0H45M0S","recipeCategory":"P\u0159edkrmy a chu\u0165ovky","recipeInstructions":["<p>Smetanu a nastrouhan\u00e9 tvar\u016f\u017eky dejte do kastr\u016flku. Za st\u00e1l\u00e9ho m\u00edch\u00e1n\u00ed zah\u0159\u00edvejte tak, aby se tvar\u016f\u017eky rozpustily d\u0159\u00edv, ne\u017e se sm\u011bs za\u010dne va\u0159it.<\/p>","<p>Pot\u00e9 odstavte a nechte vychladnout. B\u011bhem chladnut\u00ed sm\u011bs ob\u010das prom\u00edchejte. Jakmile vychladne, dejte ji asi na p\u016fl hodiny do lednice a pot\u00e9 vy\u0161lehejte do p\u011bny.<\/p>","<p>Cukety omyjte, ponechte slupku a nakr\u00e1jejte je pod\u00e9ln\u011b na pl\u00e1tky siln\u00e9 asi p\u016fl centimetru. Na p\u00e1nvi rozeh\u0159ejte mal\u00e9 mno\u017estv\u00ed oleje a pl\u00e1tky zvolna ope\u010dte dom\u011bkka.<\/p>","<p>Nechte je okapat na pap\u00edrov\u00e9 ut\u011brce a vychladnout. Na ka\u017ed\u00fd pl\u00e1tek cukety polo\u017ete pl\u00e1tek parmsk\u00e9 \u0161unky, p\u0159idejte tvar\u016f\u017ekovou p\u011bnu a zarolujte. Rolku m\u016f\u017eete zajistit p\u00e1r\u00e1tkem.<\/p>"]}</script>
